      <div class="mu7-specs__row"><span class="mu7-specs__label">Bedienkonzept</span><span class="mu7-specs__val">Touch + physische Tasten + Gestensteuerung · Smart Automation · individuell anpassbare Kurzbefehle</span></div>
      <div class="mu7-specs__row"><span class="mu7-specs__label">Ergonomie</span><span class="mu7-specs__val">Wide Tilting Angle (großer Neigungsbereich für ergonomischen Komfort)</span></div>
      <div class="mu7-specs__row"><span class="mu7-specs__label">Bedienfeld</span><span class="mu7-specs__val">Vollständig versiegelt · einfache Reinigung &amp; Desinfektion</span></div>
      <div class="mu7-specs__row"><span class="mu7-specs__label">Robustheit</span><span class="mu7-specs__val mu7-specs__val--highlight">0,5 m Falltest · 30G Stoßresistenz · geräuschloser Betrieb</span></div>
      <div class="mu7-specs__row"><span class="mu7-specs__label">Sondenports</span><span class="mu7-specs__val mu7-specs__val--highlight">2 aktive Anschlüsse</span></div>
      <div class="mu7-specs__row"><span class="mu7-specs__label">Bildmodi</span><span class="mu7-specs__val">B-Mode · M-Mode · PW-Doppler · Color · Power Doppler</span></div>
      <div class="mu7-specs__row"><span class="mu7-specs__label">Bildverbesserung</span><span class="mu7-specs__val">PSH™ (Phase Shift Harmonic Imaging) · iBeam™ (Spatial Compounding) · iClear™ (Speckle Suppression)</span></div>
      <div class="mu7-specs__row"><span class="mu7-specs__label">Smart-Funktionen</span><span class="mu7-specs__val">iTouch · Smart Track · Smart Calc · iScape™ View · ExFOV · AutoIMT</span></div>
