      <div class="mu7-specs__row"><span class="mu7-specs__label">Workflow</span><span class="mu7-specs__val">iWorks (Workflow-Protokolle) · iStation (Patientendaten-System)</span></div>
      <div class="mu7-specs__row"><span class="mu7-specs__label">Akku</span><span class="mu7-specs__val mu7-specs__val--highlight">Li-Ionen · &gt; 4 Stunden netzunabhängig</span></div>
      <div class="mu7-specs__row"><span class="mu7-specs__label">Speicher</span><span class="mu7-specs__val">256 GB Festplatte (integriert)</span></div>
      <div class="mu7-specs__row"><span class="mu7-specs__label">Konnektivität</span><span class="mu7-specs__val">Integriertes WLAN · Netzwerk · HDMI Output · 3× USB 3.0</span></div>
      <div class="mu7-specs__row"><span class="mu7-specs__label">DICOM</span><span class="mu7-specs__val">Vollständige DICOM-Konformität · Speicher &amp; Worklist</span></div>
      <div class="mu7-specs__row"><span class="mu7-specs__label">Digitales Ökosystem</span><span class="mu7-specs__val mu7-specs__val--highlight">Remote Collaboration · Built-in Learning · MiCo+ App · individuelle Scan-Protokolle</span></div>
      <div class="mu7-specs__row"><span class="mu7-specs__label">Klinische Schwerpunkte</span><span class="mu7-specs__val">Leber · Niere · Schilddrüse · Periphere Gefäße · Uterus · Nabelschnur · Blase</span></div>
